{"id":"n17419-2-8","stage":4,"title":"야영 · 野营","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17419-2-8-1","ko":"여름휴가는 잘 다녀왔니?","zh":"夏天休假玩得好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여름휴가는","meaning":"暑假，暑期休假","explanation":"여름휴가：暑假，暑期休假；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"여름휴가","audio":"/audio/2f326418aa384e842b6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22667","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름휴가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여름휴가는","audio":"/audio/30682426ca78c06c01d0.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，了不起地","explanation":"잘：很好地，了不起地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"8","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"다녀왔니?","meaning":"去一趟，去了趟","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去了趟；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"1","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다녀왔니","audio":"/audio/e11859b5f26fc6916e9e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2f326418aa384e84","term":"여름휴가","zh":"暑假，暑期休假","audio":"/audio/2f326418aa384e842b6e.mp3","entryId":"22667","definition":"在夏季上学或上班的人在一定期间休息。","pronunciation":["여름휴가"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，了不起地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常好地、优秀地，值得称赞地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟，去了趟","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3","entryId":"64529","definition":"去某地后又回来。","pronunciation":["다녀오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/86879feaffeeef8c1df6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17419-2-8-2","ko":"응. 가족들과 야영도 하고 즐거운 시간이었어.","zh":"嗯，和家人露了营，玩得很开心。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"가족들과","meaning":"家庭，家人","explanation":"가족：家庭，家人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44487","senseId":"1","lemma":"가족","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가족들과","audio":"/audio/a3e89ffa2a04e35bba2e.mp3"}},{"text":"야영도","meaning":"野营，露营","explanation":"야영：野营，露营；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"야영","audio":"/audio/1cc0ce1a48eff0ecd37d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17419","senseId":"2","lemma":"야영","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"야영도","audio":"/audio/154080e0f4c135909f8e.mp3"}},{"text":"하고","meaning":"做（야영을 하다：露营）","explanation":"하다：做（야영을 하다：露营）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하고","audio":"/audio/1a7140c02481d065b267.mp3"}},{"text":"즐거운","meaning":"愉快，欢乐，欢快","explanation":"즐겁다：愉快，欢乐，欢快；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"즐겁다","audio":"/audio/71ab7f4d89daedabda61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62101","senseId":"1","lemma":"즐겁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"즐거운","audio":"/audio/b976aba1e2d93272736d.mp3"}},{"text":"시간이었어.","meaning":"光阴，时光","explanation":"시간：光阴，时光；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"5","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간이었어","audio":"/audio/62b8e51d44e35ed6e75d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"7659575fd72a872b","term":"가족","zh":"家庭，家人","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3","entryId":"44487","definition":"主要指聚在一起生活，由婚姻、父母、子女、兄弟等的关系构成的社会单位；或指其成员。","pronunciation":["가족"]},{"id":"1cc0ce1a48eff0ec","term":"야영","zh":"野营，露营","audio":"/audio/1cc0ce1a48eff0ecd37d.mp3","entryId":"17419","definition":"在休养或度假等时在野外支撑帐篷睡觉或停留。","pronunciation":["야ː영"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做（야영을 하다：露营）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做（야영을 하다：露营）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"71ab7f4d89daedab","term":"즐겁다","zh":"愉快，欢乐，欢快","audio":"/audio/71ab7f4d89daedabda61.mp3","entryId":"62101","definition":"内心满意、满足且快乐。","pronunciation":["즐겁따"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"光阴，时光","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"自然而然流逝的岁月。","pronunciation":["시간"]}],"audio":"/audio/482dbee8d57a52e09a8e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.3,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=17419","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":123,"sequenceScore":2.1267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["夏天休假玩得好吗？","嗯，和家人露了营，玩得很开心。","啊，今天又要加班了。都已经好几周这样了，这到底算什么啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["夏天休假玩得好吗？","嗯，和家人露了营，玩得很开心。","啊，今天又要加班了。都已经好几周这样了，这到底算什么啊。"],"answer":1}]}
